<title>JAPAN: Kobe rubber market closed Thursday for Sports Day.</title>
<headline>Kobe rubber market closed Thursday for Sports Day.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kobe rubber futures market is closed on Thursday for Sports Day and will reopen Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the benchmark March contract settled 1.5 yen higher at 134.2 yen per kg, while the other contracts settled 1.2 to 2.1 yen higher.</p>
</text>
